{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BENEATH JERUSALEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/Generic_Tunnel_No_torch_Optimized.gif?t=1742577487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1187 AD, Jerusalem. Saladin\u2019s army looms as you, driven by greed, delve into cursed tunnels for gold\u2014but darkness hides danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JERUSALEM\u2019S GREEDY HAVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/JerusalemPad.gif?t=1742577487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Jerusalem, locals feign kindness, offering to bargain for gear or accept charity to lift your spirit\u2014but their greed exploits your gold hunger, hiking prices or banning you, leaving you desperate for more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RINGING BELLS, DEMONIC THREAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/indark.gif?t=1742577487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bells toll, unleashing the ancient Jerusalem demons\u2019 plague\u2014light your torch or lose faith to greed\u2019s whispers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DUNGEONPEDIA\u2019S SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/DungeonPedia.gif?t=1742577487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into history\u2019s empires\u2014uncover geography, figures like Herodotus, and artifacts in timeless ancient learning at your leisure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JERUSALEM\u2019S DESPERATE LOANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/Usurer.gif?t=1742577487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When bargaining fails o